      "parameters": {
        "content": "## IMP\nIts going to lead to improved accuracy and quality beacause each step focuses on specific task  which will help reduce errors and hallucinations. \n\nGreater control over each step \n\nwe can refine the system prompt of the outline writer and then we can refine the prompt of the evaluator. so we can really tweak whats going on and how data is being tranfered \n\n1. 2.0 Flash: we just need a brief outline to be written here\n2. 4o mini: Its a little more powerfull, a little more expensive but still not bad and we want this more powerful chat model to be doing the evaluating and refining the outline \n3. Claude 3.5 or Deepseek R1: Actual blog writing content, beacuse its going to be more powerful and going to take that revised outline and then strcture a really nice blog post for us",
